WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,850 --> 00:00:03,140
Get up, Mr. Li

2
00:00:04,540 --> 00:00:05,860
This is no ordinary old mountain squire

3
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:07,660
Where did this Kyoshi come from?

4
00:00:08,300 --> 00:00:13,190
Are the bamboo roots still in your hands, Mr. Li?

5
00:00:13,550 --> 00:00:20,600
Is there a living Mr. Li in the wine industry?

6
00:00:20,680 --> 00:00:21,640
Tell me the truth

7
00:00:21,720 --> 00:00:28,410
Is the bamboo root still there or not? This one is Kyoshi.

8
00:00:28,450 --> 00:00:29,570
Health insurance is at the bottom

9
00:00:29,970 --> 00:00:31,410
This is the rule of mountaineering craftsmen

10
00:00:32,350 --> 00:00:33,510
Dong Hang just bombed the frame

11
00:00:34,030 --> 00:00:34,990
Go out if you don’t want to
